      "sequence_position": 1,
      "problem": "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t)=-3{x}_{1}(t)+2{x}_{2}(t)+5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)+7\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t)=4{x}_{1}(t)-{x}_{2}(t)+3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe systems of linear ODEs above can be written in matrix form as follows:\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" height=\"30px\" align=\"center\">${x}^{′}(t)=\\,\\,$</td>\n\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"40px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"40px\" align=\"center\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td width=\"40px\" align=\"center\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n\n<td rowspan=\"2\" height=\"40px\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,x(t)+\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"30px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-3}}</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" height=\"40px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n\n<td rowspan=\"2\" height=\"40px\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)+\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"30px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-4}}</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" height=\"40px\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-5}}</td>\n<td width=\"30px\" align=\"center\">{{field-6}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"30px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-7}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"30px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-8}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
